            "review_title": "Review at Soi10 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Batiso\nHanoi, Vietnam71 contributions\n0\nBest Thai food in Ha Noi\nDec 2015 • Friends\nI had travelled to Thailand many times and tried Thai food alot. Frankly Thai food serving here have same tastes as original food in Thailand especially Crabs with curry & eggs. This is truly since as talked with manager they have 3 Thai cooks to prepare food. The restaurant design quite high end, clean and look modern style. Staff are quite helpfull and serving food very fast. Overal this is the best Thai food in Hanoi recommend you during your stay.\nRead more\nWritten December 17, 2015",
