            "review_text": "FelisaNguyen\nJohor Bahru, Malaysia17 contributions\n0\nThe best crab restaurant in town\nJul 2015 • Couples\nA very cool restaurant to treat your family and friends with fresh Nam Can crabs - the best crabs in Vietnam from Vung Tau in Hanoi. Crab curry with light Chinese herbs' aroma and Fried glory morning are must-eat here. Restaurant's decoration is very simple but elegant.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2015",
